notes.content:
[list]
[*]Visual enhancements to all arenas; 
[*]Various loading bug fixes;
[*]General maintenance and bug fixes.
[/list]

* Removed sequential unlock requirement for Campaign mode;
* Fixes for crash bug when starting a new game upon completion of a game;
* Increased the size of the user interfaces  on smaller devices;
* Applied scaling to UI for different screen aspect ratios;
* General aesthetic updates for the main menu;
* Modified camera reset button to handle current human team in pass-to-play mode;
* General maintenance and updates.

[h2]* Updated soldier visuals[/h2] - graphics for all soldiers have been enhanced;
[h2]* Introduced new unit [/h2]- Flamer unit;
[h2]* Introduced gaming room [/h2]- game play takes place in a bedroom for increased immersion;
[h2]* Updated game UI[/h2] - the user-interface has been upgraded;
[h2]* General fixes and updates[/h2].

* Introduced rewarded tournaments and leaderbaords;
* AI updates;
* UI bug fixes;
* general maintenance.

Added a new color set - available in match-play;
fix to make downloadable conent more efficient in prearation for new maps;
fix for bug for All for Life IAP item validation;
UI updates;
minor bug fixes;
general maintenance.
